<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0284c7">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <title>Insights — Impact in Business Recruitment</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resource-centre.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/index.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    .page-wrapper {
      background: white;
      max-width: 1920px;
      min-height: 1080px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    /* Unified resource CTA styling */
    .resource-cta {
      background: #afb8e9;
      border: 1px solid #afb8e9;
      color: #000;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 150px;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Contact code uses Arial for clarity */
    .contact-code {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    /* Navigation dropdown menu */
    .nav-dropdown {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .dropdown-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid #afb8e9;
      color: #092a4b;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .dropdown-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(175, 184, 233, 0.15);
    }
    .dropdown-content {
      display: none;
      position: absolute;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      min-width: 200px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      padding: 12px 0;
      z-index: 1;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #e6e9ee;
      top: 100%;
      left: 0;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .dropdown-content a {
      color: #092a4b !important;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .dropdown-content a:hover {
      background-color: rgba(175, 184, 233, 0.1);
    }
    .nav-dropdown:hover .dropdown-content {
      display: block;
    }

    /* Search bar styling */
    .search-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      border: 1px solid #afb8e9;
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-left: 16px;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .search-input {
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      flex: 1;
      outline: none;
    }
    .search-button {
      background: #007bff;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .search-button:hover {
      background: #0056b3;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    <header class="resource-nav" role="banner">
      <div class="container container-nav">
        <div class="logo" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
          <img src="/160.jpg" alt="Impact logo" class="site-logo" style="height:36px;width:auto;display:block">
          <span class="site-title" style="color:lightgrey">Impact in Business Recruitment</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation dropdown menu -->
        <div style="flex:1;display:none;align-items:center;margin-left:24px" id="topNavMenu">
          <div class="nav-dropdown">
            <button class="dropdown-btn">☰ Menu</button>
            <div class="dropdown-content">
              <a href="/index.html">Members Area</a>
              <a href="/insights.html">Insights</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Top nav search (visible only to authenticated users) -->
        <div id="topNavSearch" class="top-nav-search" style="flex:1;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-left:12px">
          <div style="position:relative;max-width:480px;width:100%">
            <input id="siteSearchInput" type="search" placeholder="Search site resources..." aria-label="Search site" style="width:100%;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #d0d7de;outline:none;box-sizing:border-box;background:#fff;" />
            <div id="searchResults" style="position:absolute;top:110%;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(2,6,23,0.08);max-height:320px;overflow:auto;display:none;z-index:1000"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button id="navToggle" class="btn btn-outline" aria-label="Toggle menu" style="display:none">☰</button>

        <!-- Search bar -->
        <div class="search-bar" style="display:none">
          <input type="text" class="search-input" placeholder="Search insights..." aria-label="Search insights">
          <button class="search-button" type="button">Search</button>
        </div>

        <div class="user-menu">
          <code class="contact-code">
            <b>Enquiries:</b> 07940916731
          </code>
          <a class="btn btn-outline nav-login" href="/login.html" id="signInLink">Sign In</a>
          <button class="btn btn-outline" id="signOutBtn" style="display:none">Sign Out</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Login section (shown when not authenticated) -->
    <div id="login-section" style="max-width:820px;margin:1.5rem auto;text-align:center">
      <div class="signin-card">
        <p class="intro-note">Please sign in to access this resource.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="center-buttons">
          <div id="g_id_signin" aria-hidden="false"></div>
          <div id="google-login-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="color:lightgrey; margin-left:8px;">Not signed in</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Protected content -->
    <main id="protected-content" class="container" role="main" style="padding:3rem 0;max-width:900px;display:none">
      <h1>Insights</h1>
      <p class="lead">Curated insights and research on Human Resources, recruitment trends, and talent management.</p>

      <div style="margin-top:2rem">
        <p>Hello, <strong id="userName">Member</strong></p>
      </div>

      <section class="container" style="padding:2rem 0">
        <article style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">AI and Talent Acquisition</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem">Published: 15 February 2026</p>
          <p>Explore how artificial intelligence is transforming recruitment processes, from candidate sourcing to performance prediction. This article examines practical applications and ethical considerations.</p>
          <a href="#" class="resource-cta" style="display:inline-block">Read More</a>
        </article>

        <article style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Future of Remote Work in HR</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem">Published: 08 February 2026</p>
          <p>Strategies for managing distributed teams, maintaining company culture, and leveraging technology in a hybrid work environment. Learn from industry leaders on best practices.</p>
          <a href="#" class="resource-cta" style="display:inline-block">Read More</a>
        </article>

        <article style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Upskilling and Workforce Development</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem">Published: 01 February 2026</p>
          <p>Comprehensive guide to building effective employee development programs. Discover frameworks for identifying skill gaps and creating pathways for career growth in your organization.</p>
          <a href="#" class="resource-cta" style="display:inline-block">Read More</a>
        </article>

        <article style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:8px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Diversity and Inclusion in Recruitment</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem">Published: 25 January 2026</p>
          <p>Building diverse teams through inclusive hiring practices. Explore bias mitigation strategies, legal considerations, and metrics for measuring D&amp;I impact.</p>
          <a href="#" class="resource-cta" style="display:inline-block">Read More</a>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:3rem;text-align:center">
        <hr>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem">More insights coming soon. Check back regularly for updates on HR trends and best practices.</p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="resource-footer">
      <div class="container" style="text-align:center"></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);">
    <a href="https://github.com/ibrgroupintl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">GitHub</a>
